// CRABDEN - the archaeologist's face, twenty-one ways.
//
// This is his own portrait sheet, brought down onto the game's grid: every
// frame box-sampled to 59x64 and quantised to one shared 47-colour ramp, so
// his face is made of the same size of pixel as the sand he is standing on
// instead of being a smooth painting pasted over it. One crop box was used
// for all twenty-one, so the head does not jump when the expression changes.
//
// Generated from the uploaded sheet - do not hand-edit. Index 0 is nothing.

